  "text": "def merge_sorted_lists(list1, list2):\n    merged = []\n    i = 0\n    j = 0\n    while i < len(list1) and j < len(list2):\n        if list1[i] <= list2[j]:\n            merged.append(list1[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            merged.append(list2[j])\n            j += 1\n    merged.extend(list1[i:])\n    merged.extend(list2[j:])\n    return merged",
